   $q$The writer wants sentence 5 to slow the pacing and use sensory detail. Which revision does this best?$q$, $q$[{"text":"We waited, and soon enough the comet appeared right where it was supposed to be.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"rushes-resolution"},{"text":"We waited for a long time, which was very boring for everyone on the hill.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"tells-not-shows"},{"text":"We waited while the wind picked up, the cocoa went lukewarm, and the stars disappeared one by one.","is_correct":true},{"text":"We waited, since waiting is an important part of astronomy as a science.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"generic-explanation"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$We waited while the wind picked up, the cocoa went lukewarm, and the stars disappeared one by one.$q$, $q$The wind, cooling cocoa and vanishing stars let the reader feel time passing and hope fading. "Very boring" tells a feeling without any details to see or feel.$q$, 'draft', '889c5e8c-d2ae-54ab-bcb8-2938fb757d75')
