   $q$What is the main purpose of sentence 9 in the writer's argument?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It introduces a new claim that electric buses are cheaper to run than diesel buses.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-purpose"},{"text":"It shows that Solberg disagrees with the city's decision to replace its diesel buses.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It repeats the survey percentages from sentence 7 so the reader remembers them.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-repetition"},{"text":"It explains why the bus route evidence is stronger, since a change on one street rules out other differences between a park and a highway.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It explains why the bus route evidence is stronger, since a change on one street rules out other differences between a park and a highway.$q$, $q$A park and a highway differ in shade, soil and traffic, so sentence 7 alone could have other explanations; sentence 9 points out that the before and after change on one route isolates the effect of cleaner air. The draft never says Solberg disagrees with the bus decision.$q$, 'draft', '27392148-b5b7-5528-9db6-194b6a6c773f')
