   $q$Which sentence should be removed because it does not help explain why the school lasted?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Sentence 3","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"Sentence 8","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"Sentence 5","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-analysis"},{"text":"Sentence 9","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Sentence 9$q$, $q$Sentence 9 describes how canal boats were pulled, which has nothing to do with the school's success. Sentence 5 is the writer's explanation of why the lessons drew students, so cutting it would remove analysis the draft needs.$q$, 'draft', '61903b11-9d54-544c-a03c-0167e95daf4a')
