  ('8ec0ba13-e2ac-5608-8cac-e3ed73d33746', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g12-argument-writing'), null, 'easy',
   $q$Which transition, added to the beginning of sentence (8), best shows its relationship to sentence (7)?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Therefore,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"cause-effect-for-contrast"},{"text":"In summary,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"summary-for-contrast"},{"text":"Likewise,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"similarity-for-contrast"},{"text":"Still,","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Still,$q$, $q$Sentence (7) admits costs and risks, and sentence (8) shows how they can be reduced, so a contrasting transition like "Still" fits. "Therefore" is wrong because the club's donation is not a result of the repair costs.$q$, 'draft', '242328e9-3dd5-568d-a0d2-763fe7f08981')
