   $q$Which sentence, added after sentence 14, would best conclude the report?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Honestly, everybody should go out and try goalball this weekend.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"informal-call-to-action"},{"text":"Wheelchair rugby is another sport that has grown quickly in recent years.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"introduces-new-topic"},{"text":"Built around sound rather than sight, goalball offers athletes with visual impairments fair, fast competition, and its growth suggests many communities now value it.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Spectators at goalball games must stay silent while the ball is moving.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"restates-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Built around sound rather than sight, goalball offers athletes with visual impairments fair, fast competition, and its growth suggests many communities now value it.$q$, $q$The correct sentence ties the design of the game (paragraphs 1 to 3) to the growth in paragraph 4 and states its significance. The sentence about silent spectators only repeats sentence 8.$q$, 'draft', '19bea673-c1df-5e3a-b681-673831efe452')
