   $q$Which sentence, added after sentence 13, would best conclude the report?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Snapping shrimp are among the loudest animals that live in the ocean.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"introduces-new-detail"},{"text":"Everyone should buy an underwater speaker and help save the reefs.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-call-to-action"},{"text":"Reef soundscapes, then, are both a measure of a reef's condition and a possible tool for restoring it, though sound alone cannot undo damage to coral.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The study near Calloway Atoll lasted for a total of six weeks.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"restates-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Reef soundscapes, then, are both a measure of a reef's condition and a possible tool for restoring it, though sound alone cannot undo damage to coral.$q$, $q$The correct sentence brings together the definition, the study and the limitation into one statement of significance. The six-week detail only repeats sentence 8.$q$, 'draft', '826cc092-a76a-51b9-8926-27ac2b2c98c8')
