   $q$What is the main purpose of sentence 3 in the narrative?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It explains the history of the building where the narrator volunteered.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-setting-with-attitude"},{"text":"It shows the narrator's boredom so the change in sentence 4 has meaning.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It provides a conclusion that sums up what the narrator learned.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-function"},{"text":"It introduces Clara Voss as the main character of the narrative.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misplaces-character-introduction"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It shows the narrator's boredom so the change in sentence 4 has meaning.$q$, $q$Sentence 3 establishes that the narrator was scanning without reading, which makes "That changed in box 19" a real turning point. Clara is not introduced until sentence 5.$q$, 'draft', '4fcac98b-d0a9-5bea-94f7-a57ba1c483af')
